		"boilerplateTitle": "About Kaneo",
		"boilerplate": "Kaneo is an open-source project management platform created by Andrej Acevski. Teams can organize tasks in board and list views, assign work, set priorities and due dates, and connect GitHub. Kaneo is available under the MIT license for self-hosting, or as a managed service through Kaneo Cloud.",
